= Zhang-Wu Alliance

After the disastrous betrayal of the Guominjun during the Second Zhili-Fengtian War, Feng Yuxiang has solidified his control over the northeast provinces of Shanxi, Suiyuan, Chahar and Henan.
Feng, the Christian Warlord, has recently begun asking for aid from the Soviet Union, our own patrons.

The Japan-aligned and ambitious Zhang Zuolin has stayed opposed against Feng Yuxiang. Duan Qirui, basically a figurehead in the capital, stays in the center of this conflict.

- @next: Continue...

@next

Both Feng Yuxiang and Zhang Zuolin had began courting Wu Peifu, to join whichever side and overturn the balance.

Unexpectedly, just only reeling from the effects of the Second Zhili-Fengtian War, Wu Peifu has sealed an alliance with Zhang Zuolin.

It seems that Feng's betrayal stings more than Zhang's own blow to Zhili. The balance in the north tips.
